   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"6\">\n  <li>The height, in meters, of a roller coaster is modeled by the function <span data-math=\"h(x) = -2x^2 + 20x + 5\">h(x) = -2x^2 + 20x + 5</span> where <span data-math=\"x\">x</span> is the number of seconds after starting.<br> <br> Approximately how many seconds pass before the roller coaster reaches the ground? Use graphing technology if needed.</li>\n</ol>",
